message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "wronskian-constant: exact computation of the Wronskian constants const(n)"
abstract: >-
  Multi-modular solvers for const(n), the integer relating alternating compositions
  of weighted differential operators to the Wronskian of the weights, together with
  a certificate for the associated mod-p identity.
